  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "194,192.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **212** and **916**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n212 \\times 916 &= 212 \\times (900 + 16) \\\\\n&= 212 \\times 900 + 212 \\times 16 \\\\\n&= 190,\\!800 + 3,\\!392 \\\\\n&= 194,\\!192\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{194,\\!192}\n\\]",
      "logprobs": null,
