      "text": "482,780.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **505** and **956**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n505 \\times 956 &= 505 \\times (900 + 50 + 6) \\\\\n&= 505 \\times 900 + 505 \\times 50 + 505 \\times 6 \\\\\n&= 454,\\!500 + 25,\\!250 + 3,\\!030 \\\\\n&= 482,\\!780\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{482,\\!780}\n\\]",
