      "index": 0,
      "text": "399,286.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **761** and **526**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n761 \\times 526 &= 761 \\times (500 + 26) \\\\\n&= 761 \\times 500 + 761 \\times 26 \\\\\n&= 380,\\!500 + (761 \\times 20 + 761 \\times 6) \\\\\n&= 380,\\!500 + (15,\\!220 + 4,\\!566) \\\\\n&= 380,\\!500 + 19,\\!786 \\\\\n&= 399,\\!286\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{399,\\!286}\n\\]",
