  "id": "cmpl-b8242a96dd1e499a8d4969573339a582",
  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1754580188,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "500,310.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **765** and **654**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n765 \\times 654 &= 765 \\times (600 + 50 + 4) \\\\\n&= 765 \\times 600 + 765 \\times 50 + 765 \\times 4 \\\\\n&= 459,\\!000 + 38,\\!250 + 3,\\!060 \\\\\n&= 500,\\!310\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{500,\\!310}\n\\]",
