  "id": "cmpl-90613c560e0b4cd1b50a1cc83bf6aa9f",
  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1754580189,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "437,019.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **677** and **647**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n677 \\times 647 &= 677 \\times (600 + 40 + 7) \\\\\n&= 677 \\times 600 + 677 \\times 40 + 677 \\times 7 \\\\\n&= 406,\\!200 + 27,\\!080 + 4,\\!739 \\\\\n&= 437,\\!019\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{437,\\!019}\n\\]",
