messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 798 and 557?', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 798 and 557, I'll start by breaking down the multiplication into more manageable parts using the distributive property.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 798 by 500, which is straightforward since multiplying by 100 is simple. 798 multiplied by 500 equals 399,000.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 798 by 50. Multiplying by 10 gives me 7,980, so multiplying by 50 gives 39,900.\n\nThen, I'll multiply 798 by 7. Calculating this directly, 798 times 7 equals 5,586. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-dc19b48258f54d99abc2d60b01ec8d42",
  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1754581001,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "444,486.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **798** and **557**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n798 \\times 557 &= 798 \\times (500 + 50 + 7) \\\\\n&= 798 \\times 500 + 798 \\times 50 + 798 \\times 7 \\\\\n&= 399,\\!000 + 39,\\!900 + 5,\\!586 \\\\\n&= 444,\\!486\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{444,\\!486}\n\\]",
      "logprobs": null,
      "finish_reason": "stop",
      "stop_reason": null,
