messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 651 and 653?', '<think>.\nTo find the product of 651 and 653, I can use the difference of squares formula.\n\nFirst, I notice that 651 and 653 are two numbers that are 2 units apart. This means I can express them as (652 - 1) and (652 + 1), respectively.\n\nUsing the difference of squares formula, (a - b)(a + b) equals a squared minus b squared.\n\nSubstituting the values, I get 652 squared minus 1 squared.\n\nCalculating 652 squared gives me 425,104, and 1 squared is 1. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
