messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 228 and 449?', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 228 and 449, I'll start by breaking down 449 into 400 and 49.\n\nFirst, I'll multiply 228 by 400, which gives me 91,200.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 228 by 49. To make this easier, I'll break down 49 into 40 and 9.\n\nMultiplying 228 by 40 gives me 9,120, and multiplying 228 by 9 gives me 2,052.\n\nAdding these two results together, 9,120 plus 2,052 equals 11,172. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
