messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 355 and 375?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 355 and 375, I'll start by breaking down each number into its place values.\n\nFirst, I'll express 355 as 300 + 50 + 5 and 375 as 300 + 70 + 5.\n\nNext, I'll use the distributive property to multiply each part of the first number by each part of the second number.\n\nThis will give me several multiplication terms that I'll calculate individually.\n\nAfter obtaining all the products, I'll add them together to get the final result.\n\nFinally, I'll sum all these terms to find the total product of 355 and 375.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
