messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 722 and 880?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 722 and 880, I'll start by breaking down the numbers to make the multiplication easier.\n\nFirst, I'll separate 880 into 800 and 80. This allows me to multiply 722 by each part individually.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 722 by 800. Multiplying by 100 gives me 72,200, and multiplying by 8 gives me 5,776. Adding these together results in 77,976.\n\nThen, I'll multiply 722 by 80. Multiplying by 10 gives me 7,220, and multiplying by 8 gives me 57,760. Adding these together results in 64,980.\n\nFinally, I'll add the two partial products together: 77,976 plus 64,980 equals 142,956.\n\nSo, the product of 722 and 880 is 142,956.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
