      "text": "548,240.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **623** and **884**, we'll perform the multiplication step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n623 \\times 884 &= 623 \\times (800 + 80 + 4) \\\\\n&= 623 \\times 800 + 623 \\times 80 + 623 \\times 4 \\\\\n&= 498,\\!400 + 49,\\!840 + 2,\\!492 \\\\\n&= 548,\\!240\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{548,\\!240}\n\\]",
      "logprobs": null,
